==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6~30 seconds<sup>180f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]]. When Hippoe spawns, spam meatshields and your strongest units until you can win.

